MODULE: CENTERED_UI_RULES

OBJECTIVE:
Enforce center-aligned typography and layout hierarchy.

RULES:
- HeadersCenterAligned
- ButtonsCenterAligned
- LessonTitlesCenterAligned
- ExplanationsCenterAlignedUnlessLongFormReadingRequiresBetterLineFlow
- RewardTextCenterAligned
- MissionBriefingTextCenterAligned
- HUDCardsSymmetrical
- PrimaryActionsCentered

EXCEPTIONS:
- LongReadingParagraphsMayUseReadableMaxWidth
- DataTablesMayUseColumnAlignment
- CodeBlocksMayUseMonospaceLeftAlignment
